From 62b629c5ff6810466f2e8caaac28baa5dfaf10a7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: joebereczki <41107035-joebereczki@users.noreply.replit.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Feb 2026 15:53:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 044/244] Move message dispatching to server and simplify
 client script

Refactor ceo-proxy.cjs to use the 'ws' library for WebSocket proxying, enabling server-side interception of '@worker' messages. This change also simplifies the client-side worker-chat.js by removing its message interception logic.

